  "result": "```json\n{\n  \"smpl.ordering.models.QuoteItemInfo\": {\n    \"summary\": \"Represents a line item of catalog item products transmitted from client to service. This class implements Comparable and contains two fields: skuNumber (String) and amount (double). Key methods include: compareTo() for natural ordering based on SKU number; properly overridden equals() and hashCode() methods that consider both SKU and amount; getters and setters for skuNumber and amount properties. The amount field represents the quantity of the item that is quoted or ordered. The class provides both a default constructor and a parameterized constructor that accepts SKU and amount values. Related to CatalogItem model and used in quote processing workflows.\",\n    \"file_path\": \"smpl/ordering/models/QuoteItemInfo.java\"\n  }\n}\n```",
